206
00:09:17,014 --> 00:09:18,686
Who collects the taxes.

207
00:09:18,686 --> 00:09:19,848
Who sells drugs.

208
00:09:19,848 --> 00:09:20,938
Who moves guns.

209
00:09:20,938 --> 00:09:22,464
Who holds which role.

210
00:09:22,914 --> 00:09:25,719
Others allegedly conspired to commit murder

211
00:09:25,719 --> 00:09:28,589
and assault, to protect the gang's business.

212
00:09:28,589 --> 00:09:31,460
Members who break the rules face discipline.

213
00:09:31,460 --> 00:09:34,330
Cooperating with police, the complaint says,

214
00:09:34,330 --> 00:09:35,309
