215
00:09:35,759 --> 00:09:38,563
The drugs listed in the case include

216
00:09:38,563 --> 00:09:42,537
methamphetamine, fentanyl, heroin, cocaine and PCP.

217
00:09:42,537 --> 00:09:46,120
Officers seized firearms, ammunition, parts of

218
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,068
ghost guns, and fentanyl.

219
00:09:48,518 --> 00:09:51,788
Investigators now estimate the gang at about

220
00:09:51,788 --> 00:09:53,869
500 members, in six cliques.

221
00:09:53,869 --> 00:09:55,281
Two of them female.

222
00:09:55,731 --> 00:09:58,486
The Los Angeles County district attorney,

223
00:09:58,486 --> 00:10:01,375
Nathan Hochman, described it with a monster

224
00:10:01,375 --> 00:10:02,451
from Greek myth.

225
00:10:02,901 --> 00:10:05,897
LAPD chief Jim McDonnell said the department

226
00:10:05,897 --> 00:10:08,961
would use every tool available to protect the

227
00:10:08,961 --> 00:10:09,642
community.

228
00:10:10,092 --> 00:10:12,139
These charges are allegations.

229
00:10:12,139 --> 00:10:15,072
Every defendant is presumed innocent unless

230
00:10:15,072 --> 00:10:16,641
proven guilty in court.

231
00:10:17,641 --> 00:10:19,042
Two thousand eleven.

232
00:10:19,042 --> 00:10:20,582
Two thousand nineteen.

233
00:10:20,582 --> 00:10:22,333
Two thousand twenty-five.

234
00:10:22,333 --> 00:10:25,344
Three major cases against the same gang, in

235
00:10:25,344 --> 00:10:26,815
the same harbor town.

236
00:10:27,265 --> 00:10:30,946
In 14 years, its leaders have been indicted,

237
00:10:30,946 --> 00:10:32,117
and sentenced.

238
00:10:32,117 --> 00:10:35,799
The estimates of its size have changed, from

239
00:10:35,799 --> 00:10:39,480
