241
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:44,417
But by investigators' own account, it's still here.

242
00:10:44,867 --> 00:10:47,395
Each one takes years of investigation.

243
00:10:47,395 --> 00:10:49,192
Each one ends with arrests.

244
00:10:49,192 --> 00:10:51,920
And in the last two, prosecutors describe

245
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:54,848
orders and money running between the street,

246
00:10:54,848 --> 00:10:56,045
and a prison cell.

247
00:10:56,495 --> 00:10:59,330
In a hydra, you cut off one head, and another

248
00:10:59,330 --> 00:11:00,023
