249
00:11:00,023 --> 00:11:02,166
That's the challenge in San Pedro.

250
00:11:02,166 --> 00:11:03,867
Not just catching the gang.

251
00:11:03,867 --> 00:11:06,702
Cutting the line that runs from the street to

252
00:11:06,702 --> 00:11:07,269
the cell.

253
00:11:08,069 --> 00:11:10,010
Case file 004. Closed.

254
00:11:10,010 --> 00:11:13,274
The next file is already on the desk.
